b>: <a href=\"Practitioner-example.html\">Practitioner Adam Careful </a></p><p><b>sender</b>: <a href=\"Organization-example.html\">Organization Health Level Seven International</a></p><blockquote><p><b>payload</b></p><p><b>content</b>: Portable chest radiograph report is final with no acute cardiopulmonary abnormality.</p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>payload</b></p><p><b>content</b>: <a href=\"DiagnosticReport-note-example.html\">Portable chest radiograph report</a></p></blockquote></div>"
